you want to use?

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.801
-Chucky.
-Tell Chucky I said hello and --

00:00:35.801 --> 00:00:37.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.667 --> 00:00:38.667
This next one was sent in

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:40.868
