00:00:54.234 --> 00:00:57.167
Super simple.

00:00:57.167 --> 00:00:58.200
-Oh, great.
-It's so easy.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:00:59.734
Once you find your card...
-Yeah?

00:00:59.734 --> 00:01:01.601
-...you call the number
on the back and then, yeah.

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:03.534
-And it only costs $25
to replace your card.

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.067
-Sir, it's probably in your hand
right now.

00:01:05.067 --> 00:01:05.968
"Oh, thanks."

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:06.968
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.968 --> 00:01:08.100
This next one was sent in

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:10.400
