00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:17.868
[ Applause ]

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.734
I remember that.

00:01:19.734 --> 00:01:20.901
I remember that poster.

00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:21.767
-Oh, yeah.
He's got legs.

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:23.734
-I remember that movie.

00:01:23.734 --> 00:01:26.634
This next one was sent in
by Tom Vess in Croatia.

00:01:26.634 --> 00:01:27.767
