00:03:06.167 --> 00:03:07.968
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:03:07.968 --> 00:03:09.400
-"Uh, we're here with Steen."

00:03:09.400 --> 00:03:11.467
Come in.
Come right in.

00:03:11.467 --> 00:03:14.200
He was reading some local news
